Date: Thu, 10 Sep 2026 18:13:51 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Title: Add animal detection, real trajectory guidance,
 and Flask dashboard

Key features implemented:
- Added animal detection using animal_best.pt with dynamic class loading and fallback width mapping
- Integrated animals into obstacle pipeline with distance, speed, TTC, and risk calculations
- Replaced simple direction arrow with real safe-path trajectory based on obstacles and drivable area
- Created trajectory_planner.py with compute_safe_trajectory and draw_trajectory functions
- Extended 3D rendering to support animal objects with appropriate mesh types
- Built Flask web dashboard with Video, Camera, Analytics, and Reports pages
- Connected Flask to existing processing pipeline and report generation
- Added temporal smoothing for stable direction and trajectory predictions

The implementation maintains existing ADAS functionality while adding comprehensive animal detection, intelligent trajectory planning, and a full web interface with real-time analytics and reporting capabilities. The system gracefully handles missing animal model and integrates animals seamlessly into all existing safety calculations.
